{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "GIZRA Restaurant Integration API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Integration API for connecting an external POS / KDS system to GIZRA.\n\nA restaurant partner uses this API to:\n1. Pull orders placed on GIZRA into their own POS.\n2. Push order status changes back to GIZRA (accept, start cooking, ready for handover, delivered, cancel).\n\n## Availability of each section\n\nAll endpoints in this document are tagged `x-availability: live` — implemented and verified against `https://backend.gizra.app`. Nothing in this document is planned or hypothetical.\n\n## Two ways to authenticate\n\n1. **Account token** (`/api/v1/vendor/*`) — bearer token from the restaurant's own login. Full account access. Fastest way to start testing.\n2. **Scoped partner key** (`/api/v1/partner/*`) — `X-Gizra-Key` + HMAC request signing, issued per-restaurant from the GIZRA admin panel. Scoped (`orders:read` / `orders:write` / `menu:read`), revocable, optionally IP-restricted, and never exposes the restaurant's password. **Recommended for any production integration.** Contact GIZRA integrations to have a key issued — there is no self-service endpoint for creating one.\n\nThe orders/status endpoints behave identically either way; only the auth headers differ.\n\n## Integration model available today\n\nTwo options, and they can be combined:\n\n- **Polling.** Call `GET .../current-orders` on an interval (10-30 s recommended), diff against what has already been seen, and call `.../update-order-status` as the kitchen progresses the order.\n- **Webhooks.** Register an HTTPS endpoint (via GIZRA admin panel) and GIZRA POSTs `order.created` / `order.status_changed` to it as they happen, HMAC-signed, with retry for 24h. Removes the need to poll. See the `OrderEvent` schema.\n\n## Time and money formats\n\n- Timestamps in order records are `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS` in the restaurant's local time, except `created_at`/`updated_at` on nested objects which may be ISO-8601 UTC.\n- Money values are numbers in the restaurant's currency. The currency symbol is returned by `GET /api/v1/config` (`currency_symbol`).\n",
    "contact": {
      "name": "GIZRA Integrations",
      "email": "Gyzrh13@gmail.com"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://backend.gizra.app",
      "description": "Production"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    { "name": "Authentication", "description": "Obtaining and using an access token." },
    { "name": "Orders", "description": "Pulling orders into the partner POS." },
    { "name": "Order status", "description": "Pushing kitchen progress back to GIZRA." },
    { "name": "Restaurant", "description": "Restaurant profile and configuration." },
    { "name": "Partner API", "description": "Scoped, signed access via X-Gizra-Key — the recommended auth path for production integrations." },
    { "name": "Webhooks", "description": "Push delivery of order events. Registered via the GIZRA admin panel." }
  ],
  "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/auth/vendor/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Authentication"],
        "summary": "Log in and obtain an access token",
        "operationId": "vendorLogin",
        "x-availability": "live",
        "security": [],
        "description": "Returns a bearer token for the restaurant account.\n\n**The token does not expire on a fixed schedule.** Store it securely on the partner server, never in browser or mobile client code. If the restaurant changes its password, request a new token.\n\nSee the security notes in the description of `bearerAuth`: sharing the restaurant's own password with an integrator is discouraged. Scoped partner keys are the planned replacement.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["email", "password"],
                "properties": {
                  "email": { "type": "string", "format": "email", "example": "restaurant@example.com" },
                  "password": { "type": "string", "format": "password", "example": "••••••••" }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Authenticated",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "token": { "type": "string", "description": "Bearer token. Send as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`." },
                    "is_phone_verified": { "type": "boolean" }
                  }
                },
                "example": { "token": "t3hmpZFAlLLqDFVqLjdR5PId…", "is_phone_verified": true }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Account suspended or not permitted",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": { "errors": [{ "code": "auth-002", "message": "Your account is suspended" }] }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Credentials not recognised",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": { "errors": [{ "code": "auth-001", "message": "Credentials do not match" }] }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },

    "/api/v1/config": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Restaurant"],
        "summary": "Platform configuration",
        "operationId": "getConfig",
        "x-availability": "live",
        "security": [],
        "description": "Currency symbol, time format, order confirmation model and payment options. Read once at partner startup and cache; it changes rarely.\n\nThe fields most integrations need are `currency_symbol`, `currency_symbol_direction`, `timeformat`, `order_confirmation_model` and `order_delivery_verification`.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Configuration",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "type": "object" },
                "example": {
                  "business_name": "Gizra APP",
                  "country": "IL",
                  "currency_symbol": "₪",
                  "currency_symbol_direction": "left",
                  "timeformat": "24",
                  "order_confirmation_model": "restaurant",
                  "order_delivery_verification": true,
                  "cash_on_delivery": true,
                  "digital_payment": true,
                  "take_away": true,
                  "home_delivery": true
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },

    "/api/v1/vendor/profile": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Restaurant"],
        "summary": "Restaurant profile and order counters",
        "operationId": "getProfile",
        "x-availability": "live",
        "description": "Use this to confirm the token is valid and to read the restaurant id, delivery time and today/week/month order counters.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Profile",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Profile" }
              }
            }
